            "notes": "Finish the build. \n\nThat's right, it is finished. Any changes to  [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) or  [Vishkar Condensor](item_086a91da-b65d-4047-8fc7-28a992078b1d) means that you are losing out a tremendous amount of damage. \n\nThis build depends on high survival to deal high damage.\n\n [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) pushes you over some damage thresholds for your ultimate and provides tons of survivability since you are constantly using your boosters. This also works on your missiles.",
