            "created_at": "2025-08-31T21:13:52.998867+00:00",
            "notes": "You may notice you aren't changing anything, good, don't. You will continue to bulk up as you earn money and progress the rounds and obtain powers. \n\nRemember, survival is damage. If your team is really competent at following up with your high value slams and punishing any slams that peals for them, then keep  [Dae-Hyun\u2019s Detonator](item_cf3e51e1-12c7-4d92-a68b-7742f98fe8fa)  as you are doing exactly as you need to. You are making space. \n\nOtherwise, if survival is an issue, but you wear your opponent down, consider less power ultimate's for additional survival to make yourself nearly unkillable and boosting your slam even further.\n\n [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d)  helps against most of DVA's most powerful antagonists.\n\n [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) is more technical. If you are confident you will punch at the start of your booster and still work in your Slam, then by all means utilize this ridiculously powerful option which increases damage, survival, and chasedown potential at the cost of ultimate damage/range.",
